1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Nothing further is known about Gunder Jonsen's father, other than his name - Jon.
2 CONT
2 CONT He is NOT connected to the Benkestok family.
2 CONT
2 CONT (confirmed by Tore Vigerust 16 Sept. 2010)
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT father of Gunder Jonsen Bringsvaer - all that is Known about him is his name JON.
2 CONT
2 CONT He is NOT connected with the Benkestok family.
2 CONT
