2 CONC  Hafridsson's and Bengt Algotsson's family connections in general, I refer to an essay by me in Sv. Historisk tidskrift p. 172 and to H. Hildebrand's genealogy in Illustrated Swedish History, 2, p. 24. KHK 1 Sv. Sig. fr. Middle Ag
2 CONC es 3: 103, 307, 308, 714; Sv. RP n Sv. Hist. Journal 1885, p Sv. RP n Sv. D. 3, n Sv. D. 4. n 172 and to H. Hildebrand's genealogical table in Illustrated Swedish History, 2, p. 24. KHK 1 Sv. Sig. fr. Middle Ages 3: 103, 307, 308,
