2 CONT
2 CONT Sissela is the best known of Sæbjørn Toresson's daughters. She was
2 CONT
2 CONT married twice, the first time to Knut Olsson Nordre Hidle and secondly
2 CONT
2 CONT to Bjørn Lauritsson Øvre Bjørheim. Knut and Sissela lived at Nordre
2 CONT
2 CONT Hidle, which her father owned. After Knut's death, Sissela married
2 CONT
2 CONT Bjørn Lauritsson and moved to Øvre Bjørheim, where she lived until she
2 CONT
2 CONT died sometime before 1614. The value of her estate at her death
2 CONT
2 CONT appears to have been about 12 1/2 laupar smør.
