2 CONT
2 CONT Torbjørn Jonsen Skofteland was born before 1400 at Skofteland, South Audnedal, Vest Agder, Norway. He Torbjørn Jonsen and 11 other farmers in Lists len wrote in 1443 to the king and asked to get back their former sysselmann, Hartv
2 CONC ig Krumme Dike. Brevet (DN V 518) is dated Kvåvik, where Torbjørn lived. It was NOK also the same Torbjørn Jonsen which in 1429 was one of the three lagrettsmennene in Lyngdal that OvervÃ the transfer of the vicarage. (DN IV 610) 
2 CONC <nowiki>----------------</nowiki> between 1429 and 1443. He died after 1443 at Kvavik, Lyngdal, Vest Agder, Norway. He is mentioned Lyngdal 622.Sør-Audnedal 283. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Torbjørn Jonsen Skofteland was born before 1400 at Skofteland, Sør-Audnedal, Vest Agder, Norway. He Torbjørn Jonsen og 11 andre bønder i Lister len skrev i 1443 til kongen og ba om å få tilbake sin tidligere sysselmann, Hartvig Kr
2 CONC ummedike.
2 CONT
2 CONT Brevet (DN V 518) er datert Kvåvik, hvor Torbjørn bodde.
2 CONT
2 CONT Det var nok også den samme Torbjørn Jonsen som i 1429 var en av de tre lagrettsmennene i Lyngdal som overvar overdragelsen av prestegården.
2 CONT
2 CONT (DN IV 610 )<nowiki>----------------</nowiki> between 1429 and 1443. He died after 1443 at Kvavik, Lyngdal, Vest Agder, Norway. He is mentioned Lyngdal 622.Sør-Audnedal 283.
