2 CONT Karen Bergsdtr Egeland married Olluf Halvdansen Reppen. She died at Reppen Br.1.I, Nes, Vest Agder, Norway. She was born in 1520 at Egeland ytre, Kvinesdal, Vest Agder, Norway. She is mentioned
