2 CONT
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Bjørn Knutsson and his wife, Borghild Henriksdatter, lived at Erøy
2 CONT from the late 1630s until 1654 and afterwards at Vågagarden in Imsland.  He leased 3 laupar at Våga (which belonged to the king), but by 1665 he owned property at 21 farms in Ryfylke.  In Erfjord, Bjørn owned 3 laupar at Erøy, 1 p
2 CONC und smør at San dvik, ± laup at Tednes, 2 pund smør at Håland and ± laup at Bogland. In 1645, Bjørn paid 1 mark 8 shillings in Poll Tax.  His total estate was valued at over 16 laupar smør.
