2 CONT
2 CONT Audbjørg Olufsdtr Austad was born at Austad Br.1., Austad, Vest Agder, Norway. She died at Vatlan, Kvås, Vest Agder, Norway. She married Bjørn Stenussen Vatland, son of Stenu (--?--) Vatland, before 1590. She nevnt Kvås 49. Austad
2 CONC  180.
2 CONT
2 CONT Bjørn Stenussen Vatland was born at Vatland, Kvås, Vest Agder, Norway. He married Audbjørg Olufsdtr Austad, daughter of Olav Grimsen Austad and Hilleborg Hujesdtr ?, before 1590. He died in 1623 at Vatland, Kvås, Vest Agder, Norwa
2 CONC y. He nevnt Kvås 49.
