2 CONT Reference: Book
2 CONT
2 CONT Nes 2.I.50,26.
2 CONT
2 CONT Nes 2.I.26.
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne Vermundsdtr Kvanvik was born at Kvanvik, Hidra, Vest Agder, Norway. She married Eirik Stålesen Flikka,  son of Ståle Eriksen Flikka. She died at Flikka Br.1.II., 
2 CONT
2 CONT Eirik Stålesen Flikka was lagrettsmann. He married Anne Vermundsdtr Kvanvik, daughter of Vermund Toresen Kvanvik and Ingeborg Nilsdtr Birkeland. He was born before 1563 at Flikka Br.1.I., Nes, Vest Agder, Norway. He is mentioned N
2 CONC es 2.I.26.
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne Vermundsdtr Kvanvik was born at Kvanvik, Hidra, Vest Agder, Norway. She married Eirik Stålesen Flikka,  son of Ståle Eriksen Flikka. She died at Flikka Br.1.II., 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ståle Eriksen Flikka married (--?--) Olufsdtr Tengs, daughter of lensmann Oluf Torgersen Tengs and Siri Isaksdtr ?. He was born before 1591 at Flikka Br.1.I., Nes, Vest Agder, Norway. He is mentioned Nes 2.I.50,26.
2 CONT
2 CONT (--?--) Olufsdtr Tengs was born at Tengs 9d, Eigersund, Rogaland, Norway. She married Ståle Eriksen Flikka, son of Eirik Stålesen Flikka and Anne Vermundsdtr Kvanvik. She is mentioned Nes 2.I.50.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT (source: Signe Elisabeth Zijdemans)
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Anna Vermundsdatter arvet ved skiftet etter faren, Vermund Toreson Kvanvik, i 1543 jord i Fidsel i Hidra verdsatt til 1 mark gull.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Kilde: Bygdebok Nes l s. 342, Nes ll, halvbind 1 s.26, Bakke ll s. 365. Hun arver i 1543 etter faren jord i Fidsel i Hidra verdsatt til 1 mark gull. Hun giftet seg til garden Flikka gnr. 79 b.nr. 1.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Kilder: Bygdebøkene Nes l s. 342 og Nes ll, halvbind 1 s. 26. Bakke ll s. 365. Født på garden Kvanvik, Hidra. Giftet seg til garden Flikka, Nes, gnr. 79 bnr. 1.
