2 CONT Algot Brynjulfsen Lejon was born in Sweden. He married Kristina Tolvesdtr Sweden, daughter of Tolve Petersen. He married Margareta Ulfsdtr Lejon Sweden, daughter of Ulf Carlsen. He died after 1330. ( he was mentioned as already de
2 CONC ad in a document 16 dec. 1302).
2 CONT
