2 CONT
2 CONT Hetl.skp.355? '''[Nothing about him there, but son owned land at Kolestrand in 1624...].'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Torlaksen Drange. He is mentioned Lund 110.Hetl.skp.355? He left a will on 5 Jul 1676 at Konstali. '''[This is the probate of a completely different person, namely [https://www.geni.com/people/Knut-Ovedal-Konstali/6000000011706897
2 CONC 242 Knut Håversen Ovedal/ Konstali (Lindland)].'''
2 CONT
2 CONT (--?--) Sigbjørnsdtr Drange was born at Drange, Heskestad, Rogaland, Norway. She married Knut Lauritsen Sira nedre, son of Lars Sjursen Sira and Madelinne (--?--).
