1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Is there any ''evidence'' that Mikkel Tothammer had a daughter named Marie Mikkelsdatter that was married to Jon Reiarsen Sandsmork?''' No such wife is mentioned in [https://www.nb.no/items/7030d184bbc50ed3e1dac
