1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Cources: Holum Bygdebok site 373.
2 CONT
2 CONT A rich farmer. Owned properties: Haddeland, Nedre Nøding, Rosseland i Greipstad, Hønneland, Augland in Oddernes, Hægebostad in Vigmostad, Vallesvær in Høvåg and Metveit in Landvik.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Holum bygdebok re: Haddeland - staar i skattelistene fram til 1620; in 1610 there was  listing for Bjorn Haddeland as "husmann som bor hos Leilending"; also named  medoppsitter; lagrettesman i 1570.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was connected with Nils Gunnarsen Haddeland; it is presumed that he was son-in-law - since Bjorn's children took over farms in Haddeland -- and Bjorn's children were:
2 CONT *Nils;   
2 CONT *Jon;   
2 CONT *Bent;   
2 CONT *Hoskild;   
2 CONT *Ingeborg;  & 
2 CONT *Asgjer.
2 CONT
2 CONT It appears to be the same aetta...
