1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mette Børgesdatter, datter av Børge Torgrimsen Birkeland  ble født ca 1575 i Birkeland, Feda, Vest-Agder og døde ca 1630 i Birkeland, Feda, Vest-Agder i en alder av omkring 55 år.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mette giftet seg med Kristoffer Klaussen Birkeland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mette giftet seg deretter med Tore Bessesen.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.nb.no/items/c5401f3f121da0aff274747ba3743741?page=43&searchText=%C3%A6tt%20og%20heim%201969
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Mette was from Hundingsland in Flekkefjord, and was the daughter of Børge Torgrimson Hundingsland 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the sister of Torgrim Hundingsland at Austad.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT She was married to Kristoffer Klausson Birkeland, and lived at Birkeland in Feda, Flekkefjord.[1] Their children were:
2 CONT
2 CONT Klaus, 66 years old in 1664, lived at Kåda[2] Børge, born about 1600,[1] 64 years old in 1664, lived at Aubø[2] Hans, 50 years old in 1664, lived at Fora[2] She was later married to Tore Bessesen, who died in 1632 or 1633 the nigh
2 CONC t after a fight with Sven Hansen, the son of the rådmann in Stavanger; he probably fell in the sea and drowned.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources ↑ 1.0 1.1 1.2 Finnøy 4, p. 532. ↑ 2.0 2.1 2.2 2.3 2.4 Feda : gards- og slektshistorie, p. 242. Næss, Hans Eyvind. Finnøy gards- og ættesoge 4 - Sjernarøy 1. Finnøy kommune, 2006. Årli, Ånen. Feda : gards- og slektshistorie
2 CONC . Published 1980. Available to Norwegian IPs at Nasjonalbiblioteket See also:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.geni.com/people/Mette-Hundingsland/6000000003332737016 accessed 3 May 2020
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------------------------------------------
