2 CONT
2 CONT Another name for Birgitte was Birgitte Sevatsdatter. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Birgitte married Torgils Johannesson Torsnes. (Torgils Johannesson Torsnes was born in Torsnes, Jondal, Hordaland, Norway.)
2 CONT
