1 NOTE {geni:about_me} google translate of the Norwegian with not enough corrections yet!
2 CONT
2 CONT General note: In Erfjord book says that a daughter of Olaf Knutson Haaland was also probably married with an Asgaut, and they were the parents of Lars Asgautson Jørstad. Who Asgaut, father of Lars Asgautson Jørstad, was we know no
2 CONC t. It is guessed that he was one Asgaut Bo (Saebo skipreide) which is chronicled in 1617 and had letters AL in sign kit, or one Asgaut Holta (Årdal skipreide) that navigation in 1611 moved to Hidle- in Sjernarøy, where zone Lars J
2 CONC ørstad, Ola, divorce later. Equally eins GISS ein in ein Asgaut Hansson Norheim Sjernarøy who lagrettemann in Saebo skipreide in 1597 may be the father of Lars Asgautson Jørstad. In 1666 lasted Olav Helgeson reunions into things c
2 CONC ollection on Steinnes, shoulder leigemål with Berta Andersdotter. Simon Nordbø lasted då summoned as a witness. He stated that he was uncle to Ola, Ola and Berta was forlova, and that they akta to marry the first. This brother Hel
2 CONC ge Asgautson may be he who is chronicled in Upper Landa in Finney. It's ish mogeleg that Simon had ein brother Ola. Ein Ola Asgautson Nordbø fekk in 1698 her daughter Inger. (See also: Rogaland Historielag Årshefte 1942 page 31)
2 CONT
2 CONT In the book Nedstrand says that the personal mark to Asgaut Overland stands AO He came to farm the same year as James Erikson moved to are calling. In things the book in 1629 states that Asgaut had budd 18 years time at Holta in S
2 CONC trand. He paid leiglendingsskatt in Strand in the years 1603-1612. Asgaut are tax lists on overland in the years 1641 to 1645. He spent 1½ LAUP in garden in 1647. Sidan he must have spent half the garden of 2½ Lauper butter då joi
2 CONC ning Overland, must consumption have wart shared anything before 1647. The zone Jon had received 1 LAUP in garden. In 1664 had dockable son, Eivind, got his father attverande use 1½ LAUP. Asgaut had ein son at home in its own use 
2 CONC in 1645. It is chronicled kids Eivind, Jon, Kirsti and may Anna Baustad.
2 CONT
2 CONT If this is the same Asgaut is uncertain.
2 CONT
2 CONT Asgaut were married with Olsdotter approximately 1590 in Jelsa church, Jelsa, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of this pair:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. Lars Asgautson born approximately 1590 in Holta, Strand, Rogaland, NOR and died approximately 1660 in Jørstad, Sjernarøy, Rogaland, NOR ein age of about 70 years. Lars were married with Siri Olsdotter approximately 1613 in Hjel
2 CONC meland church, Hjelmeland, Rogaland, NOR. Lars were married then with Birgitte Hadlesdotter approximately 1645 Sand church, Sand, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. Ole Asgautson born in Holta, Strand, Rogaland, NOR and died in Nordbø, Finnøy, Rogaland, NOR. Ole marry as unknown
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. Helge Asgautson bron approximately 1604 in Holta, Strand, Rogaland, NOR and died in 1664 in Landa upper Finnøy, Rogaland, NOR ein age of about 60 years. Helge were married with as unknown
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. Eivind Asgautson born approximately 1609 in Holta, Strand, Rogaland, NOR and died in Overland, Nedstrand, Rogaland, NOR. There is another names for Eivind was Effven.
2 CONT
2 CONT v. Kirsti Asgautsdotter born in Holta, Strand, Rogaland, NOR and died in Overland, Nedstrand, Rogaland, NOR. Kirsti were married with Eivind Torgerson approximately 1645 in Nedstrand church, Nedstrand, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT vi. Simon Asgautson. Simon were married with Ingeborg Larsdotter approximately 1640 in Hesby church, Finney, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT vii. Anna Asgautsdotterborn in Holta, Strand, Rogaland, NOR and died in Baustad, Nedstrand, Rogaland, NOR. Anna were married Peder Jensson approximately 1670 in Nedstrand church, Nedstrand, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT viii. Jon Asgautson born approximately 1624 in Holta, Strand, Rogaland, NOR and died in Overland, Nedstrand, Rogaland, NOR. There is another names for Jon was Joen.
2 CONT
