1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Erik Trondson was born in 1630 in Berge, Sand, Rogaland, NOR and died in 1708 in Natland, Erfjord, Rogaland, NOR at age 78. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Erik married Malena Knudsdotter circa 1662 in Jelsa kyrkje, Jelsa, Rogaland, NOR. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children from this marriage were: 
2 CONT
2 CONT i.  Knud Erikson was born in 1663 in Natland, Erfjord, Rogaland, NOR and died in 1726 in Natland, Erfjord, Rogaland, NOR at age 63. Knud married Siri Olsdotter circa 1684 in Jelsa kyrkje, Jelsa, Rogaland, NOR. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ii.  Torger Erikson was born in 1666 in Natland, Erfjord, Rogaland, NOR and died in 1732 in Sørhus, Erfjord, Rogaland, NOR at age 66. Torger married Martha Olsdotter on 21. Nov 1697 in Jelsa kyrkje, Jelsa, Rogaland, NOR. 
2 CONT
2 CONT iii.  Sønneva Eriksdotter. Sønneva married Johannes Olson circa 1694 in Jelsa kyrkje, Jelsa, Rogaland, NOR. 
2 CONT
2 CONT iv.  Henrik Erikson was born circa 1675 in Natland, Erfjord, Rogaland, NOR. 
2 CONT
2 CONT v.  Ole Erikson was born circa 1680 in Natland, Erfjord, Rogaland, NOR and died circa 1740 in Rørtveit, Erfjord, Rogaland, NOR at age 60. Ole married Gjøa Mikkelsdotter circa 1703 in Suldal kyrkje, Suldal, Rogaland, NOR. 
