1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Kvinesdal ei bygdebok; vol.2 gards- og ættesoga by Ånen Årli. + `Randi Hansdatter Duvold in Lista Married to Einar Andersen Duvold. They lived at Lindland at least in the years 1610-1617. They inherited Duvold from
2 CONC  Randi's parents, because it is Ragnhild Gullestad who owns the farm in 1618. In Abraham Berge's book on Lista it is said that Einar Duvold is the son of one Ole of Duvold. That is not right. Einar Duvold is called Einar Andersen 
2 CONC in 1623 and had in 1610 E.A. in his personal mark.' 
