1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''It seems highly unlikely that Asser Toresen Heskestad was a son of Tore Eriksen Heskestad (Helleren),''' as suggested by "Heskestad sokn: Gard, ætt og folk". The latter died between 1619 and 1622. According to h
2 CONC is [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20070618620538 burial record, dated 15-11-1716], Asser was 84 years old at death, thus born about 1632. This is supported by the [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/ft10041010271052 1701 Manntall], w
2 CONC hich states that he was 70 years old at the time, thus born about 1631. The other children of Tore Eriksen Heskestad (Helleren)were born between about 1575 and 1610 or so. If Asser was a son of Tore, Tore must certainly have been 
2 CONC married at least twice. It seems unlikely that both the burial record and the 1701 Manntall have given an age that is at least a decade too low. 
2 CONT ---
