1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Dybing: https://www.nb.no/items/7030d184bbc50ed3e1dac0748f60b679?page=119&searchText=heskestad%20bygdebok
2 CONT
2 CONT Ætt og Heim 1960: https://www.nb.no/items/5f0e4a8385ea53c3e2060bf36a7ced11?page=65&searchText=%C3%A6tt%20og%20heim%201960
2 CONT
2 CONT P.Valand skrev at Jakob Dybing kunne vaert gift med en datter av Tollak Assersson Arstad/Grøsfjell. Og at Torger O. Dybing kunne vaere en mulig sønnesønn, med mellomleddet hypotetisk Orm Drange, nevnt 1603?? Dvs at O kan stå for O
2 CONC rmsson, men i bygdeboka skriver den samme P.Valand at O. kan stå for Olavsson... Torger har en sønn som heter Asser Torgersson, og en annen Tollak - og det er typiske Aarstad navn. 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.nb.no/items/27bac5facc236bf627db70dff717fa64?page=119&searchText=%C3%A6tt%20og%20heim%201964
2 CONT
2 CONT P.Valand 1964: Torger O. Dybing var visst sønn eller versønn til Ola Ørsland i Sokndal etter odel å dømme. Eller sønnesønn til Jakob Dybing. Eller gift med sønnedatter hans, for Torger hadde også en sønn som het Asser Torgersson S
2 CONC andsmark.  Dvs uklart! 
2 CONT
2 CONT Jakob Dybing nevnt 1563. '''[This statement is based on a misreading of a secondary soure, which states that his father was mentioned in 1563.]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT [https://www.nb.no/items/7030d184bbc50ed3e1dac0748f60b679?page=120 "Heskestad sokn: gard, ætt og folk"] states that Torger Olsen Dybing (Ørsland) probably had a daughter "Mette Torgersdatter" that was married to "Jakob Endresen Ei
2 CONC de". This seems unlikely, as that "Mette" and her husband "Jakob Endresen" were both considerably younger than the other children of Torger. It seems more likely that [https://www.geni.com/people/Jakob-Sandsmork-Eide/6000000205699
2 CONC 248904 Jakob Endresen Sandsmork/ Eide (Elgjestraum)] was married to [https://www.geni.com/people/Mette-Sandsmork-Eide/6000000205699615841 Mette Torjusdatter Sandsmork/ Eide (Bakka)], a daughter of [https://www.geni.com/people/Torj
2 CONC us-Bakka/6000000008029035664?through=6000000205699615841 Torjus Larsen Bakka] and [https://www.geni.com/people/Marit-Bakka/6000000012034283348?through=6000000205699615841 Marit Bjørnsdatter Bakka (Fitja)].
